# The guest keeps stepping and sending but reads nothing for 3 s, and throws meanwhile.
scenario edge_deaf
scene floor_wall
seed 37
guests 1
settle 6s

net g1 rtt 100ms jitter 20ms loss 2%

p1 grab crate as grab
p1 walk 2 1
at 2s deaf g1 for 3s
at 3s p1 throw wall speed 9 as throw
p0 walk -1 -1

expect result grab granted
expect result throw done
expect agree_at_rest 5cm 5deg
expect no_stuck
